@startuml
start

:User enters search query;
:React (Frontend) sends GET request to FastAPI;

:FastAPI checks data availability;
if (Data in Redis (Caching)?) then (Yes)
  :Retrieve results from In-memory data store;
else (No)
  :Query PostgreSQL (Relational database);
  :Retrieve search results (Movies, Genres);
  :Save results to Redis for future queries;
endif

:FastAPI generates JSON response;
:React updates UI (Search & filtering);
:User views results;

stop
@enduml
